entifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/AttributedStyle","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV0A20InternationalizationE15AttributedStyleV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle","isActive":true},{"text":" instance to customize the lexical","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"representation of a date as a string. Use the format style’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attributed"},{"text":" property to customize the visual representation of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"date as a string. Attributed strings can represent the subcomponent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"characters, words, and phrases of a string with a custom combination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"of font size, weight, and color.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, the function below uses a date format style to create a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"custom lexical representation of a date, then retrieves an attributed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"string representation of the same date and applies a visual emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the year component of the date."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["private func makeAttributedString() -> AttributedString {","    let date = Date()","    let formatStyle = Date.FormatStyle(date: .abbreviated, time: .standard)","    var attributedString = formatStyle.attributed.format(date)","    for run in attributedString.runs {","        if let dateFieldAttribute = run.attributes.foundation.dateField,","           dateFieldAttribute == .year {","            attributedString[run.range].inlinePresentationIntent = [.emphasized, .stronglyEmphasized]","        }","    }","    return attributedString","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle\/attributed-swift.property","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationinternationalization\/foundationessentials\/date\/formatstyle\/attributed-swift.property"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle"]]},"deprecationSummary":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use attributedStyle instead"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"A type-erased attributed variant of this style.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://FoundationInternationalization/documentation/FoundationInternationalization/FoundationEssentials/Date/AttributedStyle":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AttributedStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/foundationinternationalization\/foundationessentials\/date\/attributedstyle","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/do